{
  "_comment_scope": "The hub starts at /games/ but its scope is the whole origin. That is on purpose: the games live at /backgammon/, /gin-rummy/ and /yahtzee/, outside /games/, and with a narrower scope every tap on a game would bounce the installed hub into a browser overlay. Each game still has its own manifest and installs as its own app from its own page.",
  "_comment_no_sw": "No service worker, same as the games: the hub will not launch offline, and in exchange nobody is ever stranded on a stale cached page.",
  "id": "/games/",
  "name": "Mouro Games",
  "short_name": "Games",
  "description": "Backgammon, gin rummy, Yahtzee and Sudoku for family game night. No accounts, no ads.",
